            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^Thank you again, «дитино» — \"my child\". Eat the cherry pies while they're warm. ",
                "#",
                "^speaker:npc_nina",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                "end",
                {
                  "->": "0.5"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "^«Ой лишенько!» Oh dear! Where is my bag? «Велика, жовта» — big and yellow, with honey for my granddaughter! ",
          "#",
          "^speaker:npc_nina",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Show her the bag you are holding",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-0",
            "flg": 20
          },
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Вибачте, я не знаю. (Sorry, I don't know.)",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-1",
            "flg": 20
          },
          {
            "c-0": [
              "\n",
              "^Oh, what have you got there? ",
              "#",
              "^quiz:bus_bag_1",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              {
                "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
              },
              "/ev",
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b",
                  "c": true
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^«Так!» Yes! The big yellow bag. Mine! Thank you!",
                    "\n",
                    "ev",
                    true,
                    "/ev",
                    {
                      "VAR=": "helped_nina",
                      "re": true
                    },
                    "ev",
                    {
                      "VAR?": "trust"
                    },
                    1,
                    "+",
                    {
                      "VAR=": "trust",
                      "re": true
                    },
                    "/ev",
                    "^Here, take some cherry pies, «пиріжки». ",
                    "#",
                    "^give:pyrizhky",
                    "/#",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.c-0.11"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b"
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^What? No, mine is yellow and big... oh, it's right there in your hands! Be more careful.",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.c-0.11"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "nop",
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "c-1": [
              "\n",
              "^Oh, I'll go look by the ticket office.",
